<title>FINLAND: RAUTAKIRJA SAYS SANOMA HAS OVER 20 PCT.</title>
<headline>RAUTAKIRJA SAYS SANOMA HAS OVER 20 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish retailer Rautakirja Oy said in a statement on Tuesday that media group Sanoma Oy had bought 50,000 Rautakirja A shares and raised its stake in it to 20.06 percent of votes and 20.11 percent of shares.  </p>
<p>Sanoma had bought the shares from privately-owned confectionery and bakery group Oy Karl Fazer Ab, Rautakirja said. It did not give the value of the deal.</p>
<p>Rautakirja said Sanoma now owned 1.08 million A shares and 220,067 B shares in it. --Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
